('raising-a-child-who-tells-the-truth-a-calm-practical-guide', 'Raising a Child Who Tells the Truth: A Calm, Practical Guide', 'Ask ten parents about raising a child who tells the truth and you''ll get ten answers, forty opinions, and one shared sigh. Below is a calm, practical way to think about it — not a ', 'Daniel Okafor', '2024-03-11', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#parenting','#raisingchild','#familyfirst','#raisingkids']::text[], 'Parenting', false, '#7c5dff', null, null, null, $json$[{"type":"p","text":"Ask ten parents about raising a child who tells the truth and you'll get ten answers, forty opinions, and one shared sigh."},{"type":"p","text":"Below is a calm, practical way to think about it — not a rigid program, just a handful of ideas you can borrow tonight and adjust for your own family."},{"type":"h2","text":"Give the choice, keep the frame"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Bath now or after this show?\" beats \"Go take a bath.\" The child gets agency; you keep the outcome. It's the oldest trick in the parenting book because it works."},{"type":"h2","text":"Say yes in spirit"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Yes, and we'll do it Saturday\" honors the want without breaking the boundary. Kids can wait; what they can't stand is feeling unheard."},{"type":"h2","text":"Let them be bored"},{"type":"p","text":"Boredom is the doorway to imagination. Resisting the urge to fill every gap teaches kids to generate their own fun — a skill worth more than any enrichment class."},{"type":"h2","text":"Siblings: coach, don't referee"},{"type":"p","text":"Stepping in to declare a winner teaches kids to recruit you as a weapon. Narrating both sides and handing the problem back — \"you two figure out a fair turn\" — builds the skill that actually ends the fighting."},{"type":"h2","text":"A simple place to start"},{"type":"p","text":"First, decide the one default that removes a daily decision. Next, add a gentle reminder so nobody has to hold it in their head. Then, write down the plan s