action — a date, a form — and turn each into a calendar event before you close the tab."},{"type":"h2","text":"A simple place to start"},{"type":"p","text":"First, start smaller than feels necessary — momentum beats ambition. Next, write down the plan so it survives a chaotic day. Then, pick the single piece of the report-card conversation that helps that causes the most friction this week."},{"type":"h2","text":"Where Bubaly fits in"},{"type":"p","text":"If keeping the report-card conversation that helps on track sounds exhausting, that's the point where Bubaly quietly helps. It's the AI operating system for family life — it remembers, reminds, and coordinates so you don't have to carry it all alone. See how at bubaly.com."},{"type":"p","text":"Give it a couple of weeks before you judge it. Habits feel awkward right up until the moment they feel obvious."}]$json$::jsonb, true),
