('rethinking-a-family-five-minute-morning-stretch-for-the-modern-family', 'Rethinking A Family Five-minute Morning Stretch for the Modern Family', 'Most families don''t struggle with a family five-minute morning stretch because they''re doing it wrong — they struggle because nobody handed them a system. Below is a calm, practica', 'The Bubaly Team', '2024-06-05', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#familywellness','#familyfiveminute','#familyfirst','#momlife']::text[], 'Wellness', false, '#f59e0b', null, null, null, $json$[{"type":"p","text":"Most families don't struggle with a family five-minute morning stretch because they're doing it wrong — they struggle because nobody handed them a system."},{"type":"p","text":"Below is a calm, practical way to think about it — not a rigid program, just a handful of ideas you can borrow tonight and adjust for your own family."},{"type":"h2","text":"Model the repair with yourself"},{"type":"p","text":"Kids learn self-care by watching. When they see you rest without guilt, apologize without shame, and ask for help without drama, you teach more than any lecture could."},{"type":"h2","text":"Move together, not perfectly"},{"type":"p","text":"A walk after dinner beats a gym membership nobody uses. Movement that's woven into family life — a bike ride, a dance-off, raking leaves — sticks because it's shared and fun."},{"type":"h2","text":"Feelings need words"},{"type":"p","text":"Kids who can name what they feel can manage it. A simple daily check-in — rose, thorn, bud — builds emotional vocabulary that pays off for a lifetime."},{"type":"h2","text":"Sleep is the keystone"},{"type":"p","text":"Fix sleep and half the other problems shrink: moods, focus, patience, appetite. Protecting bedtime is the single highest-return wellness habit a family has, and a family five-minute morning stretch gets easier once everyone is rested."},{"type":"h2","text":"A simple place to start"},{"type":"p","text":"First, pick the single piece of a family fiv