('the-reliable-weeknight-sheet-pan-chicken-without-the-overwhelm', 'The Reliable Weeknight Sheet-pan Chicken Without the Overwhelm', 'The secret to the reliable weeknight sheet-pan chicken isn''t more willpower. What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple enough to start this week, flexible enough ', 'Jessica Miller', '2024-08-15', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#familymeals','#reliableweeknight','#parentinghacks','#momlife']::text[], 'Recipes & Food', false, '#f97316', null, null, null, $json$[{"type":"p","text":"The secret to the reliable weeknight sheet-pan chicken isn't more willpower. It's less friction — fewer decisions, clearer defaults, and a plan everyone can see."},{"type":"p","text":"What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple enough to start this week, flexible enough to survive a bad Tuesday."},{"type":"h2","text":"Prep components, not full meals"},{"type":"p","text":"Cooked grains, roasted veg, and a protein in the fridge become five different dinners. Prepping building blocks beats cooking five separate meals and keeps leftovers from feeling like leftovers."},{"type":"h2","text":"Cook once, eat twice"},{"type":"p","text":"Double the batch, freeze half. A little extra effort tonight buys you a free dinner on the worst night of next week — the cheapest insurance in the kitchen."},{"type":"h2","text":"Keep a short list of house dinners"},{"type":"p","text":"Every family needs ten reliable, everyone-eats-it meals on rotation. It's not boring; it's a foundation. Save the experiments for the weekend and let weeknights be easy."},{"type":"h2","text":"Lower the stakes on dinner"},{"type":"p","text":"A simple meal eaten together beats an elaborate one served to a stressed table. The nutrition of connection is real; give yourself permission to keep it easy."},{"type":"h2","text":"A simple place to start"},{"type":"p","text":"First, decide the one default that removes a daily decision. Next, give it two weeks before you judge w