('rethinking-the-reliable-weeknight-noodle-bowl-for-the-modern-family', 'Rethinking The Reliable Weeknight Noodle Bowl for the Modern Family', 'There''s a version of the reliable weeknight noodle bowl that feels like a fight, and a version that feels like a rhythm. What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple', 'The Bubaly Team', '2024-09-11', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#familymeals','#reliableweeknight','#homelife','#momlife']::text[], 'Recipes & Food', false, '#f97316', null, null, null, $json$[{"type":"p","text":"There's a version of the reliable weeknight noodle bowl that feels like a fight, and a version that feels like a rhythm. This is about getting to the second one."},{"type":"p","text":"What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple enough to start this week, flexible enough to survive a bad Tuesday."},{"type":"h2","text":"Make vegetables the default, not the fight"},{"type":"p","text":"Put them out first, when everyone's hungry, and keep it low-drama. Roasted, with a little salt and oil, most vegetables win converts without a single negotiation."},{"type":"h2","text":"Cook once, eat twice"},{"type":"p","text":"Double the batch, freeze half. A little extra effort tonight buys you a free dinner on the worst night of next week — the cheapest insurance in the kitchen."},{"type":"h2","text":"Keep a short list of house dinners"},{"type":"p","text":"Every family needs ten reliable, everyone-eats-it meals on rotation. It's not boring; it's a foundation. Save the experiments for the weekend and let weeknights be easy."},{"type":"h2","text":"Get kids in the kitchen"},{"type":"p","text":"Children eat what they help make. Even a toddler can wash, tear, and stir, and the pride of \"I made this\" does more for picky eating than any bribe."},{"type":"h2","text":"The list builds itself"},{"type":"p","text":"A meal plan and a grocery list are the same document. Write the plan, and the list falls out of it — sorted by aisle, minus what's 