('everything-families-get-wrong-about-the-family-lighthouse-road-trip', 'Everything Families Get Wrong About The Family Lighthouse Road Trip', 'Nobody puts the family lighthouse road trip on their vision board, and yet it shapes the temperature of the whole house. What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple', 'The Bubaly Team', '2024-10-13', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#familytravel','#familylighthouse','#momlife','#worklifebalance']::text[], 'Travel & Adventures', false, '#06b6d4', null, null, null, $json$[{"type":"p","text":"Nobody puts the family lighthouse road trip on their vision board, and yet it shapes the temperature of the whole house."},{"type":"p","text":"What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple enough to start this week, flexible enough to survive a bad Tuesday."},{"type":"h2","text":"The night-before-departure reset"},{"type":"p","text":"Bags by the door, documents in one folder, phones charging, roles assigned. A ten-minute setup the night before is the difference between a smooth start and a stressful one."},{"type":"h2","text":"The adventure can be small"},{"type":"p","text":"A memorable outing doesn't require a passport. A new park, a sunrise pancake run, a night hike with flashlights — the family lighthouse road trip is really about attention, not distance."},{"type":"h2","text":"Pack a launch list, not a suitcase"},{"type":"p","text":"A reusable, family-specific packing list — refined after every trip — turns the pre-trip scramble into a calm hour. You stop reinventing it and start trusting it."},{"type":"h2","text":"Give kids a job"},{"type":"p","text":"A child with a map, a camera, or \"navigator\" duties is a child who's engaged instead of whining. Ownership turns passengers into explorers."},{"type":"h2","text":"Snacks are strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Half of travel meltdowns are hunger in disguise. A well-provisioned snack bag is the single highest-return item you'll pack, for kids and grown-ups ali